<section class="splash-1" aria-labelledby="landing-hero-title">
  <div class="splash-1-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <header class="landing-hero-nav">
    <%= link_to root_path, class: 'landing-hero-brand', aria: { label: 'SportsBeep home' } do %>
      <%= image_tag 'logo-md.png', alt: 'SportsBeep' %>
    <% end %>
    <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
      <ul>
        <li><%= link_to 'About Us', '#about-us' %></li>
        <li><%= link_to 'Why Sportsbeep', '#why-sportsbeep' %></li>
        <li><%= link_to 'Contact', '#contact-us' %></li>
        <li><%= link_to 'Sign Up', new_user_registration_path, class: 'landing-hero-nav-join' %></li>
        <li><%= link_to (current_user ? 'Play' : 'Login & Play'), play_path, class: 'landing-hero-nav-play' %></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <div class="landing-hero-content">
    <h1 id="landing-hero-title">
      <span>BET. EARN.</span>
      <strong>WIN WITH <i>$BEEP</i></strong>
    </h1>
    <p class="landing-hero-deck">
      The first sports betting protocol on <b>Cardano.</b> Secure your <b>$BEEP</b> at founder pricing before the public launch.
    </p>

    <div class="landing-countdown" data-countdown-target="" aria-live="polite" aria-label="Phase 1 countdown. Date to be announced.">
      <p class="landing-countdown-label"><span></span> PHASE 1 CLOSES IN <span></span></p>
      <div class="landing-countdown-cards">
        <div class="landing-countdown-card"><output data-countdown-days>00</output><span>DAYS</span></div>
        <div class="landing-countdown-card"><output data-countdown-hours>00</output><span>HOURS</span></div>
        <div class="landing-countdown-card"><output data-countdown-minutes>00</output><span>MIN</span></div>
        <div class="landing-countdown-card"><output data-countdown-seconds>00</output><span>SEC</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script>
  (function () {
    function startCountdown() {
      var countdown = document.querySelector('.landing-countdown');
      if (!countdown) { return; }
      var target = Date.parse(countdown.getAttribute('data-countdown-target') || '');
      if (isNaN(target)) { return; }
      function render() {
        var remaining = Math.max(0, target - new Date().getTime());
        var seconds = Math.floor(remaining / 1000);
        var values = [
          Math.floor(seconds / 86400),
          Math.floor((seconds % 86400) / 3600),
          Math.floor((seconds % 3600) / 60),
          seconds % 60
        ];
        var names = ['days', 'hours', 'minutes', 'seconds'];
        for (var i = 0; i < names.length; i += 1) {
          var field = countdown.querySelector('[data-countdown-' + names[i] + ']');
          if (field) { field.textContent = ('0' + values[i]).slice(-2); }
        }
      }
      render();
      window.setInterval(render, 1000);
    }
    if (document.readyState === 'loading') {
      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', startCountdown);
    } else {
      startCountdown();
    }
  }());
</script>
<div class="about-us">
  <div class="landing-padding">
    <a name="about-us"></a>
    <h2>About SPORTSBEEP</h2>
    <p>
      SPORTSBEEP is reimagining the future of sports engagement on the Cardano blockchain. What began as a fantasy sports concept has evolved into a Web3-powered ecosystem where fans don't just watch the game—they participate in it.
    </p>
    <p>
      At the heart of the platform is $BEEP, a fungible token (FT) minted on Cardano. $BEEP fuels access, rewards, and community features inside the SPORTSBEEP app, while also powering liquidity pools and transparent tokenomics designed to build long-term trust.
    </p>
    <p>
      SPORTSBEEP is more than collectibles—it's about utility and ownership. Fans can use $BEEP to unlock premium features, vote on platform decisions, and engage in a transparent, trust-driven economy that grows alongside the community.
    </p>
    <p>
      By leveraging Cardano's secure, energy-efficient blockchain, SPORTSBEEP delivers a fast, fair, and future-proof experience. No warehouses, no shipping, no middlemen—just a digital-first sports platform built for scale, transparency, and fan empowerment.
    </p>

    <h2>Tech Stack</h2>
    <p><strong>Blockchain Layer:</strong> Cardano mainnet, with Blockfrost API integration for wallet and transaction services</p>
    <p><strong>Token Infrastructure:</strong> Native Cardano fungible token ($BEEP), liquidity pools on Minswap, Cardano Token Registry integration</p>
    <p><strong>Frontend:</strong> React + Tailwind for a modern, responsive UI</p>
    <p><strong>Backend:</strong> Ruby on Rails + Puma server, with APIs for timers, user authentication, and token utilities</p>
    <p><strong>Mobile:</strong> Native Android app (in development) for on-the-go fan engagement</p>
    <p><strong>Deployment &amp; DevOps:</strong> GitHub (repo + SSH), Replit (rapid iteration), cPanel hosting for production builds</p>
    <p><strong>Wallet Support:</strong> Eternl, Nami, and Lace wallets for seamless user onboarding</p>
    <p><strong>Security &amp; Compliance:</strong> Transparent policy IDs, registry verification, and long-term tokenomics planning</p>

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>
      SPORTSBEEP's mission is simple: to create a trust-driven, transparent, and rewarding experience for sports fans worldwide. By blending cutting-edge crypto mechanics with the passion of sports culture, SPORTSBEEP is building a platform that's fast, fair, and future-proof—empowering fans to connect, compete, and shape the future of sports entertainment.
    </p>
  </div>
